      "title": "Diagnosed with narcolepsy",
      "duration_seconds": 46.88,
      "clips": [
        {
          "start": 3.26,
          "end": 18.5,
          "captions": [
            {
              "start": 3.76,
              "end": 5.46,
              "text": "So I want to talk"
            },
            {
              "start": 5.46,
              "end": 7.16,
              "text": "about how I got diagnosed"
            },
            {
              "start": 7.16,
              "end": 8.86,
              "text": "with narcolepsy because honestly nobody"
            },
            {
              "start": 8.86,
              "end": 10.56,
              "text": "believes me when I tell"
            },
            {
              "start": 10.56,
              "end": 11.24,
              "text": "this story."
            },
            {
              "start": 11.64,
              "end": 13.34,
              "text": "It started in my second"
            },
            {
              "start": 13.34,
              "end": 15.04,
              "text": "year of college. I was"
            },
            {
              "start": 15.04,
              "end": 16.74,
              "text": "falling asleep in lectures which,"
            },
            {
              "start": 16.74,
              "end": 18.1,
              "text": "fine, everybody does that."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "start": 34.1,
          "end": 50.6,
          "captions": [
            {
              "start": 34.6,
              "end": 36.3,
              "text": "The thing that finally made"
            },
            {
              "start": 36.3,
              "end": 38.0,
              "text": "me go to a doctor"
            },
            {
              "start": 38.0,
              "end": 39.7,
              "text": "was I fell asleep driving."
            },
            {
              "start": 39.7,
              "end": 41.4,
              "text": "Not for long. Maybe two"
            },
            {
              "start": 41.4,
              "end": 41.74,
              "text": "seconds."
            },
            {
              "start": 42.04,
              "end": 43.74,
              "text": "But I drifted into the"
            },
            {
              "start": 43.74,
              "end": 45.44,
              "text": "next lane and a guy"
            },
            {
              "start": 45.44,
              "end": 47.14,
              "text": "honked at me and I"
            },
            {
              "start": 47.14,
              "end": 48.84,
              "text": "pulled over and sat there"
            },
            {
              "start": 48.84,
              "end": 50.2,
              "text": "shaking for twenty minutes."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "start": 117.08,
          "end": 132.22,
          "captions": [
            {
              "start": 117.58,
              "end": 119.28,
              "text": "When the doctor told me,"
            },
            {
              "start": 119.28,
              "end": 120.98,
              "text": "I did not feel sad."
            },
            {
              "start": 120.98,
              "end": 122.68,
              "text": "I felt relieved. Genuinely relieved."
            },
            {
              "start": 122.68,
              "end": 124.38,
              "text": "Because it meant I was"
            },
            {
              "start": 124.38,
              "end": 125.06,
              "text": "not lazy."
            },
            {
              "start": 125.36,
              "end": 127.06,
              "text": "I had spent six years"
            },
            {
              "start": 127.06,
              "end": 128.76,
              "text": "thinking I had a character"
            },
            {
              "start": 128.76,
              "end": 130.46,
              "text": "problem. It was a neurological"
            },
            {
              "start": 130.46,
              "end": 131.82,
              "text": "condition the whole time."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
